/-!
# Queueing models and performance theory

This aggregate collects reusable queueing interfaces.  It builds on the
probability foundations while keeping queueing disciplines and their economic
performance formulas in a dedicated library branch. `AppliedModelingLib.Queueing.GPS`
is the supported domain entrypoint for the fluid generalized-processor-sharing
development, and `AppliedModelingLib.Queueing.GPS.FiniteHorizon` is the separate
entrypoint for its substantially larger executable trace and measurability
layer.
-/
